# giTrack local development environment
#
# LLM credentials are configured per user in browser Settings.
# Provider env vars below are optional local-dev defaults; production must set
# the encryption key to a persistent secret.

# Session cookie and assignment-rule encryption key. Keep this value stable
# across restarts; changing it invalidates existing sessions and saved rules.
# Generate once with: openssl rand -hex 32
# SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# For local dev without signing in, you can set a fallback provider+key here.
# In production (OpenShift) these are NOT used — users configure via Settings.
# LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3
